# The MolNexTR plugin's environment: MolNexTR, which reads structures from
# pictures, for its worker (worker.py). Set up only when the plugin is added
# (docs/PLUGINS.md); its trained model is downloaded besides, by Meno
# (manifest.json, `downloads`).
#
# MolNexTR installed from its repository at a fixed commit, pinned by the
# archive's hash, with the releases its own requirements name - but for
# pyonmttok, which reading a picture does not load: taken at a release built
# for Python 3.12 (overrides.txt), then left out.
#
# Locked for macOS and Windows (manifest.json, `systems`), with hashes, and
# with only what reading a picture loads and what that needs: what serves
# and trains models (OpenNMT-py's server, SmilesPE's training, PyTorch
# Lightning) and torch's GPU libraries for Linux are left out
# (--no-emit-package each; installed with --no-deps).
molnextr @ https://github.com/CYF2000127/MolNexTR/archive/6f6502b4ed9733dba8b1ee45d2da474576683194.tar.gz
torch
pillow
